// ==================== Sanctum Translations ====================
// Global translation strings for multi-language support
// All UI text should reference these properties instead of hardcoded strings
//
// Architecture:
// - Properties are populated from Rust via i18n service
// - Language changes trigger reload of all properties
// - Default values are English fallbacks

// ==================== Translations Global ====================

